<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    THANH TAB "KINH LONG" - BAN SANG
    ================================================================

    Ba lop, tu duoi len:

      1. tam kinh    - mau the o do trong 94%, de nen phia sau an len mot
                       chut khi danh sach cuon sat day
      2. duong vien  - mot duong ke tren, mau vien
      3. anh sang    - mot vach trang mo 1dp ngay duoi duong vien, dung
                       kieu "chi kinh bat sang" o canh tren

     Vi sao KHONG lam mo (blur) that 

    Android chi lam mo duoc PHIA SAU MOT CUA SO (Window.setBackgroundBlurRadius,
    tu API 31), khong lam mo duoc phia sau mot View nam trong cung cua so.
    `RenderEffect.createBlurEffect` lam mo CHINH view do chu khong phai nen
    sau no - dung vao day se lam mo ca icon tab.

    Ep cho co mo that se phai ve thanh tab thanh mot cua so rieng: them mot
    Window nghia la them mot lop nhan cham, mot cho de lech vi tri khi ban
    phim hien len, va mot duong de crash tren may cu. Cai gia do khong dang
    cho mot hieu ung.

    Do trong 94% + vach sang o canh tren cho dung cam giac "tam kinh" ma
    khong phai tra gia nao. Tren nen dac thi khong ai phan biet duoc; tren
    nen dang cuon thi thay mau lo mo dich chuyen - dung dieu can.
-->
<layer-list xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">

    <item>
        <shape android:shape="rectangle">
            <solid android:color="@color/kinh_nen" />
        </shape>
    </item>

    <item android:height="1dp" android:gravity="top">
        <shape android:shape="rectangle">
            <solid android:color="@color/vien" />
        </shape>
    </item>

    <item android:top="1dp" android:height="1dp" android:gravity="top">
        <shape android:shape="rectangle">
            <solid android:color="@color/kinh_sang" />
        </shape>
    </item>
</layer-list>
